  message: "FOLLOW-ON FILED: WI-ribak -- py.py populates FileAnalysis.method_return_types and class_field_types in Pass 1 and re-points py.py:5881 at the aggregated registry. That is ADR-0024 step 7 for this axis, the half this row deliberately did NOT do. It blocks WI-fihun (linked isbefore), whose residual 14 sites all read a declared type and can no longer read it from the signature string.\n\nThe acceptance test on that row is the one that proves a migration rather than a declaration: find_undeclared_value_parsers still returns [] with py.py:5881 REMOVED from LEGACY_VALUE_PARSERS -- the closed set shrinking 9 -> 8."  # 31f9
